Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  14 REMOVED_MONTH 99 ACCESSIONED ON  14 REMOVED_MONTH 99 at 16 48 CLINICAL DATA  Recurrent right breast cancer  Right simple mastectomy  stitch superior                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY  RESIDUAL FOCUS OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA AND DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  SPANNING REMOVED_DATE CM  JUST OUTSIDE THE HEALING BIOPSY SITE  SECTION G   MULTIPLE LEVELS EXAMINED  SEE NOTE  NOTE  The margins are free of tumor  Diagnosis by  SELIM NASSER  MD Signed On  21 REMOVED_MONTH 99 at 17 23 Staff Pathologist  John H  Eichhorn  M D                                                                                  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh  labelled with the patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a right mastectomy specimen weighing 510 gm  The breast measures REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE X 5 5cm  and there is an overlying skin ellipse measuring REMOVED_DATE X 8 0cm  containing the nipple on its inferior edge  The skin has a scar  2 0cm in diameter  lateral to the nipple  The deep resection margin is inked black and harbors an area of irregularity and partial retraction  in the lateral inferior quadrant  Some striated muscle is attached to the deep margin  Sectioning of the breast reveals a cavity REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE X 1 3cm  which is located in the lateral half of the breast  3 0cm from the inferior resection margin  1 0cm from the anterior skin  and 0 8cm from the deep margin  The cavity is partially filled with blood  On its medial aspect  the cavity is in continuity with a firm  white  retractile area  REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE X 1 9cm  which abutts and retracts the deep surface  This area also includes necrotic  yellow material  There is fibrous tissue connecting the anterior inferior aspect of the wall of the cavity to the overlying skin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is mainly fatty and grossly unremarkable  SECTION CODE A C  cavity  relation to deep margin  D  cavity  relation to overlying skin  E  cavity  relation to inferior  F G  cavity  H I  tissue adjacent to cavity  relation to deep margin  J  distant normal looking breast parenchyma  Resident  LAURENCE DE LEVAL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Irene Kuter  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , No_breast_biopsy.
