ate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm area  portions of which appear to abut the deep  smooth surface  Several blue black sutures are identified within this vicinity  The remaining parenchyma is unremarkable  Sections of lesion  including deep margins in A through H  with parenchyma away from lesion in I through K  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY   report_end  , No_breast_biopsy.
