   RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block F   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  27 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 15 44 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm simple right mastectomy specimen with a stitch designating the 12 o clock margin  There is an overlying tan white unremarkable skin ellipse measuring REMOVED_DATE x 9 0cm containing a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm nipple areola complex with a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm unremarkable nipple  Located 2 5cm lateral and inferior to the nipple is a 4 5cm in length well healed linear scar which comes to 0 8cm from the inferior skin margin  The anterior aspect is inked blue  the posterior black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm cavity containing dark red hemorrhagic material  The cavity is located within the mid to inferior lateral aspect of the specimen coming to 1 0cm from the posterior aspect and 2 0cm from the overlying skin  The cavity displays a red brown to white  roughened lining with indurated  ragged borders containing multiple bright yellow focal areas  consisting with fat necrosis  The parenchyma surrounding the cavity consists of dense  gritty lobulated fibrous tissue with an overall measurement of REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  Focal gritty areas come to about 0 1cm from the posterior margin  The remaining uninvolved surrounding parenchyma consists of tan yellow to white unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  No lymph nodes are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE A B  Biopsy cavity to posterior margin C D  Biopsy cavity E F  Fibrous tissue away from cavity G  Posterior margin to gritty areas H J  Sequential sections of a 6cm area of gritty fibrosis  from superior to inferior Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  MJF                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , No_breast_biopsy.
