r  The biopsy cavity grossly abuts the posterior inked margin and lies  0 1cm from the anterior blue inked margin on serial sectioning  The remaining breast parenchyma consists of dense tan white rubbery fibrous tissue  No additional discrete mass or lesion is noted  The upper outer quadrant tissue is palpated for lymph nodes  and no lymph nodes are grossly appreciated  Serial sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections  biopsy cavity to include posterior and anterior inked margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections  fibrous breast parenchyma  central breast   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections  fibrous breast parenchyma  outer breast  INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  Lymph Node  Right Axilla   Sentinel    Excision PART B  Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART C  Cryostat Frozen Section  slide only   report_end  , No_breast_biopsy.
