rgin  D E  Further representative sections of biopsy cavity  F  Representative section of unremarkable fibrous parenchyma  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm aggregate of adipose tissue from which multiple lymph nodes are identified ranging from 0 2cm in greatest dimension up to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  Representative sections from each lymph node are submitted in cassettes G through K  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  CHARLES M  FERGUSON  MD PART A  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA  PART B  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , No_breast_biopsy.
